  "notes": "A bundle of fibres lying almost parallel and lit from one side \u2014 the sheen is drawn by WHERE EACH FIBRE POINTS, and the cursor combs them. `wander` is how far from parallel they stray; at 0 it is a mirror, too high and the cat's-eye disappears. That one value is the whole material."
